me", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "diagonal", "target_term": "对角态射"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "smooth", "target_term": "光滑"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "Morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "representable", "target_term": "可表"}, {"source_term": "algebraic spaces", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "Stacks", "target_term": "叠"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}], "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n代数叠（algebraic stacks）的<ACCENT_0001>平展（étale）态射（morphism）不应被定义为相对维数（relative dimension）为<MATH_0001>的光滑（smooth）态射（morphism）。具体而言，态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>是相对维数（relative dimension）为<MATH_0003>的光滑（smooth）态射，无论如何选择群概形（group scheme）<MATH_0004>在<MATH_0005>上的作用（action）。这与我们通常认为<ACCENT_0002>平展（étale）态射（morphisms）应使切空间（tangent spaces）相互等同的想法不符。上面的例子不是拟有限（quasi-finite）的，但态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是光滑（smooth）且拟有限（quasi-finite）的（第<REF_0001>节）。然而，若<MATH_0007>的特征（characteristic）为<MATH_0008>，则我们看到，可表（representable）态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>不是<ACCENT_0003>平展（étale）的，因为基变换（base change）<MATH_0010>是从一个非约化（nonreduced）概形（scheme）到一个域（field）的谱（spectrum）的态射（morphism）。因此，若将<ACCENT_0004>平展（étale）态射（morphism）定义为光滑（smooth）且局部拟有限（locally quasi-finite）的态射，则《空间的态射（Morphisms）》中引理<REF_0002>的类似结论将不成立。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n相反，我们将从以下要求出发：“<ACCENT_0005>平展性（étaleness）”应当是在基变换（base change）下保持的性质，而且若<MATH_0011>是从一个代数叠（algebraic stack）到一个概形（scheme）的<ACCENT_0006>平展（étale）态射（morphism），则<MATH_0012>应为Deligne-Mumford。换言之，我们将要求<ACCENT_0007>平展（étale）态射（morphisms）为DM，并将使用第<REF_0003>节的内容来定义代数叠（algebraic stacks）的<ACCENT_0008>平展（étale）态射（morphisms）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n在引理<REF_0004>中，我们将把代数叠（algebraic stacks）的<ACCENT_0009>平展（étale）态射（morphisms）刻画为满足以下条件的态射（morphisms）：(a) 局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation），(b) 平坦（flat），以及 (c) 具有<ACCENT_0010>平展（étale）的对角态射（diagonal）。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的“<ACCENT_0011>平展（étale）”性质在源与目标上是<ACCENT_0012>平展（étale）-光滑（smooth）局部的，见《空间上的下降（Descent）》中的注记<REF_0005>。它也在基变换（base change）下稳定，并且在目标上是fpqc局部的，见《空间的态射（Morphisms）》中的引理<REF_0006>和《空间上的下降（Descent）》中的引理<REF_0007>。因此，由上面的引理<REF_0008>，我们可以如下定义代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphism）为<ACCENT_0013>平展（étale）的含义；当该态射（morphism）可表（representable）为代数空间（algebraic spaces）时，这与《叠（Stacks）的性质》第<REF_0009>节中定义的已有概念一致，因为由引理<REF_0010>，这样的态射（morphism）自动是DM。\n\n", "unit_id": "tag:0CIK:prose-0001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "态射的源与目标；术语表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "algebraic stacks", "target_term": "代数叠"}, {"context": "本节研究的态射性质；术语表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "étale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"context": "叠、空间与概形之间的映射；术语表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "光滑态射的维数条件；术语表无已批准词条。", "source_term": "relative dimension", "target_term": "相对维数"}, {"context": "与